      "prompt": "In G2, count the Boston orders at the weekend: =COUNTIFS(B2:B15, \"Boston\", C2:C15, \"Weekend\").",
      "teach": "**COUNTIFS(range1, criteria1, range2, criteria2, ...)** counts rows that match **every** condition. Each condition is a range and its criteria, as a pair.",
